AC2 — [operator-attested]. The fix is landed but deliberately NOT validated by an agent-dispatched live run (billable operator spend); the coordinator sequences that.

Evidence chain:
- FAILURE SIGNATURE (run 31587452003, pre-fix): tests/external/test_completion_banking_behavior_0707.py cells failed with 'a bedrock model/provider is configured but no AWS region could be resolved. Set REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION ... or AWS_DEFAULT_REGION', identically on the anthropic and openai arms.
- MECHANISM: .github/workflows/external-integration.yml exported both region vars as `${{ matrix.provider == 'bedrock' && vars.AWS_BEDROCK_CI_REGION || '' }}`, i.e. the empty string on every non-bedrock arm — while that module pins `bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6` regardless of arm. Empty region reaches build_bedrock_provider and raises the typed LLMConfigError naming the knob.
- ENV DIFF (landed, Gerrit 1658 = commit 90de9b1be3, merged 2026-08-12 19:41 UTC):
    -  AWS_DEFAULT_REGION:      ${{ matrix.provider == 'bedrock' && vars.AWS_BEDROCK_CI_REGION || '' }}
    -  REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION: ${{ matrix.provider == 'bedrock' && vars.AWS_BEDROCK_CI_REGION || '' }}
    +  AWS_DEFAULT_REGION:      ${{ vars.AWS_BEDROCK_CI_REGION || 'us-east-1' }}
    +  REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION: ${{ vars.AWS_BEDROCK_CI_REGION || 'us-east-1' }}
  Verified on merged main at lines 212-213. Every arm now resolves a region; us-east-1 applies only when the repository variable is unset.
- REGRESSION LOCK: tests/unit/test_ci_provider_matrix.py::test_every_arm_resolves_a_region_not_only_the_bedrock_arm asserts neither var mentions matrix.provider and both carry the fallback. 23 tests pass; make lint and make typecheck both exit 0 (worktree venv).
- GATES: LLM-Review +1, Verified +1 (run 31629765123). The first Verified -1 (run 31626336603) was an unrelated reconciler test-isolation flake — filed as brown-caring-weasel, and INDEPENDENTLY CONFIRMED since: commit fbb1300dab ('Stop main() test reading the real gate ref') landed on main stubbing read_pause, exactly the mechanism diagnosed here.

NEXT (operator, do not agent-dispatch): a single Live External Integration run now validates BOTH fixes together — the region export on every arm, and the anthropic arm's credential (the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY secret added per AC3). Before this pair, an anthropic-arm run could not get past its credential preflight, so the region fix was unobservable on that arm; now one run exercises both.
